  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Infraestructura Logstica de Santa Catarina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Santa Catarina Logistics Infrastructure Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es contribuir al crecimiento descentralizado, equilibrado y sostenible del desarrollo del ESC a travs de la construccin, pavimentacin y rehabilitacin de la infraestructura vial estadual.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to contribute to decentralized growth, balanced and sustainable development of ESC through construction, paving and rehabilitation of road infrastructure state.</narrative>
  </description>
